   m=2: N=9851, B=22, recovered 3/3; mean group ops 82 + mean queries 9 ; N^(1/(m+1)) = 21, sqrt(N) = 99
C5 incidence CHECK: Shoup form count (one new form per query)
   40 group ops, 25 CHECK queries (|I| up to 41): distinct-form collision events bounded by 886 pairs; failure prob <= 886/N; CHECK contributes 25, i.e. 1 per query independent of |I|
C6 jet oracle: Weierstrass reading leaks k-dependent field data; invariant reading is additive
   p=15329 N=15107: eps-coefficient dx(G+Q) took 198 distinct values over 200 random k for ONE fixed query -> depends on k -> no label-only simulator (labels are k-independent in distribution)
   invariant coordinate t(G+Q) == t(G)+t(Q) for all samples: True
